Let source be "PAYPALISHIRING".
Let rows be 3.
Let last row be rows minus 1.
Let store be an empty list of text.
For every row from 0 to last row.
Append "" to store.

Let row be 0.
Let step be 1.
Let source last be the last position of source.
For every position from 0 to source last.
Append character position of source to item row of store.
If row is 0 and last row is more than 0, set step to 1.
If row is last row and last row is more than 0, set step to 0 minus 1.
Set row to row plus step.

Let result be join store with "".
Print result.
